// A platform split needs BOTH sides. `geo` here has only one file and it is gated to a flag no build
// activates, so the module resolves to a real directory holding real sources and still contributes
// nothing at all.
//
// Left to fall through, the symptom would arrive much later and much worse — an unresolved name in THIS
// file, pointing at code that is not the problem. The import site is where the fact is known, so the
// import site is where it is reported.
import { allgated::geo::area };

fn int32 main() { return area(); }
